{"utt_id": "pet-d17-01", "scenario": "pet", "day": 17, "ts": "2026-03-18T07:45:00", "speaker": "陈屿", "text": "过渡期结束，现在豆包吃的是纯渴望成犬粮了。", "fact_refs": ["pet.food.brand.v2"]}
